Description: Multi-tenant Fax over IP server (FreeSWITCH Event Socket)
 gofaxserver is a Go-based fax relay/bridge that interfaces directly with
 FreeSWITCH via the Event Socket protocol. It supports T.38 negotiation,
 G.711 fallback, and per-tenant routing across multiple gateway types.
 .
 FreeSWITCH itself is not bundled — install it separately and point the
 `freeswitch.event_*_socket` config values at the FreeSWITCH host.
